- content_for :title, "Version Request Submitted"

%ilw-content
  %h2 Thank you!
  %h2 Your new version request has been submitted
  %p
    Once a curator has approved your request, you will be able to edit your new version draft, add and remove files,
    and submit your new version for pre-publication review. You should receive an email from a curator with a link to
    your draft within 1-2 business days.

  %p
    If you have any questions, please
    = succeed "." do
      = link_to "contact the Research Data Service team", contact_path

  - if @version_request.present?
    %p
      %strong Current status:
      = semantic_status_badge(status: @version_request.status, label: @version_request.status.to_s.titleize, sr_label: "Version request status #{@version_request.status}")
    %p
      %strong Requested at:
      = @version_request.requested_at.utc.iso8601
    - if @version_request.comment.present?
      %p
        %strong Your request note:
        = @version_request.comment

  .idb-workflow-strip.idb-workflow-strip-bottom
    %nav.idb-workflow-actions-right{aria: { label: "Version request acknowledgement actions" }}
      = link_to "Back to dataset", dataset_path(@dataset), class: "idb-button-primary"